{"3010610": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "LOVE ETERNAL", "steam_appid": 3010610, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "Run, jump, and reverse the flow of gravity itself to escape the mind of a selfish god in this challenging precision platformer. Play as Maya, a child stolen from her family on the whim of a lonely, forsaken deity, and make your way through over 100 screens filled with spikes, lasers, switches, and traps as you unravel the horrifying secret of your new prison.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010610/extras/5c9f03c8588c20b2a74775692b576da0.poster.avif?t=1785816771\" width=586 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010610/extras/5c9f03c8588c20b2a74775692b576da0.webm?t=1785816771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010610/extras/5c9f03c8588c20b2a74775692b576da0.mp4?t=1785816771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Gorgeous hand-drawn pixel art graphics bring the god’s realm to life alongside meticulously handcrafted animations boasting many thousands of frames<br></li><li> A lush, atmospheric score, equal parts unsettling and beautiful<br></li><li> Responsive, snappy controls provide challenges with a sense of mastery and acrobatic accomplishment<br></li><li> A psychological horror narrative contorts and unfolds to reveal choices beyond comprehension</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010610/extras/8b3359049ee8d46cd2a913880b129e92.poster.avif?t=1785816771\" width=586 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010610/extras/8b3359049ee8d46cd2a913880b129e92.webm?t=1785816771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010610/extras/8b3359049ee8d46cd2a913880b129e92.mp4?t=1785816771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Will you find your way home, or wander these halls carved of memory forever?", "about_the_game": "Run, jump, and reverse the flow of gravity itself to escape the mind of a selfish god in this challenging precision platformer. Play as Maya, a child stolen from her family on the whim of a lonely, forsaken deity, and make your way through over 100 screens filled with spikes, lasers, switches, and traps as you unravel the horrifying secret of your new prison.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010610/extras/5c9f03c8588c20b2a74775692b576da0.poster.avif?t=1785816771\" width=586 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010610/extras/5c9f03c8588c20b2a74775692b576da0.webm?t=1785816771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010610/extras/5c9f03c8588c20b2a74775692b576da0.mp4?t=1785816771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Gorgeous hand-drawn pixel art graphics bring the god’s realm to life alongside meticulously handcrafted animations boasting many thousands of frames<br></li><li> A lush, atmospheric score, equal parts unsettling and beautiful<br></li><li> Responsive, snappy controls provide challenges with a sense of mastery and acrobatic accomplishment<br></li><li> A psychological horror narrative contorts and unfolds to reveal choices beyond comprehension</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010610/extras/8b3359049ee8d46cd2a913880b129e92.poster.avif?t=1785816771\" width=586 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010610/extras/8b3359049ee8d46cd2a913880b129e92.webm?t=1785816771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010610/extras/8b3359049ee8d46cd2a913880b129e92.mp4?t=1785816771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Will you find your way home, or wander these halls carved of memory forever?", "short_description": "Wander a castle built of bitter memories in LOVE ETERNAL, a psychological horror platformer with devious trials and an unsettling, experimental narrative. Find a way out - or live in Shelter forever more.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Spanish - Spain, Japanese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“If you’re someone who finds themselves complaining about the state of modern games, you owe it to yourself to play Love Eternal. Even if platformers aren’t your go-to genre, the story is a strong enough motivator to see it through. If you do like platformers, well, you’re in for a treat.”<br>9/10 – Shacknews<br><br>“Love Eternal delivers on the promise of a psychological-horror platformer in most ways. Its setting and presentation create a world where you're never quite sure what reality you're in... The game gets more meta in ways than I could've predicted, and left my own brain scrambled entirely by the end of the short four-hour experience.”<br>8/10 – DualShockers<br><br>“Paralysis in the midst of ever-moving fluidity. Mundanity masking unworldly phenomena. Understanding despite an immortal incomprehensibility. This is the essence of Love Eternal... the game marries irresistible, gravity-bending challenges with an enigmatic and magnetic plot. Even if sometimes you want to, you’ll be hard put to stop.”<br>8.5/10 – The Indie Informer<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010610/01aae62991c1a4e85aa52dcf1fd347abc970171f/header.jpg?t=1785816771", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010610/c659a526294395daf4533658e6e2718e278f1066/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785816771", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010610/c659a526294395daf4533658e6e2718e278f1066/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785816771", "website": "http://www.loveeternalgame.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core 2GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX 9 compatible with at least 500MB of memory<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "legal_notice": "© 2024 brlka LLC. All rights reserved. Published by Ysbryd Games Worldwide Limited.", "developers": ["brlka"], "publishers": ["Ysbryd Games", "PLAYISM"], "demos": [{"appid": 3973960, "description": ""}], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 999, "final": 999, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$9.99"}, "packages": [1070854], "package_groups": [{"name": "default", "title": "Buy LOVE ETERNAL", "description": "", "selection_text": "Select a purchase option", "save_text": "", "display_type": 0, "is_recurring_subscription": "false", "subs": [{"packageid": 1070854, "percent_savings_text": " ", "percent_savings": 0, "option_text": "Love Eternal - $9.99", "option_description": "", "can_get_free_license": "0", "is_free_license": false, "price_in_cents_with_discount": 999}]}], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac":